  "term_and_condition": "<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(153, 92, 0); caret-color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Welcome to {merchant.domain}! Thanks for joining our Affiliate program. </span><br></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); margin-top: 0.8em; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><font color=\"#995c00\"><b>General Terms to be evaluated for our affiliate program:</b></font></p><ol><li><b>Real interest in eco-friendly, sustainable, green lifestyle. </b></li><li><b>Legit Instagram account with more than 1.000 real followers.</b></li><li><b>Blogging is a +</b></li></ol><p><b>There are 4 account tiers:</b></p><p><b>Starter Affiliate Account for 1000-2999 Followers</b></p><p>Commission 3%, Free samples starter pack</p><p><b>Advanced </b><b>Affiliate Account: 3000-9999 Followers</b></p><p>Commission 5%, Free samples basic pack, Raffle products, Buy button for blog-website<b><br></b></p><p><b>Premium </b><b>Affiliate Account: 10000-49999 Followers</b></p><p>Commission 10%, Free samples medium pack, Raffle products, Personal Discount Code 10%, Buy button for blog-website<b><br></b></p><p><b>Exclusive Affiliate Account: 50000 and above Followers</b></p><p>Commission 15%, Free samples medium pack, Raffle products, Personal Discount Code 10%, Buy button for blog-website.</p><p><b>Free / Raffle products may require a delivery fee.</b></p><p>The above rules are just an indication of our evaluation proccess, they are NOT binding in any case and boobam keeps the right to adjust or change them.<br></p><p><b>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</b></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-top: 0.8em; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(68, 68, 68); color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-color-orange120\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(153, 92, 0); background-color: transparent !important;\">These following terms and conditions apply to individuals who are accessing or using the Program both as a merchant (“we” or “merchant”) and an affiliate (“you” or “affiliate”) who refers customers to use product or service from the merchant. </span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-top: 0.8em; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(68, 68, 68); color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-color-orange120\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(153, 92, 0); background-color: transparent !important;\">By participating in the Program, Affiliate agrees to use the Program in the manner specified in, and are bound by, these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree to these Terms and Conditions in their entirety you are not authorized to register as an Affiliate or participate in the Program in any manner.</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-top: 0.8em; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(68, 68, 68); color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-color-orange120\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(153, 92, 0); background-color: transparent !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1. Approve or Reject of the Registration</strong></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-top: 0.8em; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(68, 68, 68); color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-color-orange120\" style=