r might not be assigned to one coupon code with details and usage clarified on </span><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Dashboard</strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: transparent !important;\">. If customer both click on the affiliate link and use coupon code, you will not receive a double commission. If you’re not assigned a branded coupon, then you’re not allowed to promote the coupon. </span></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-top: 0.8em; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(68, 68, 68); color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-color-orange120\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(153, 92, 0); background-color: transparent !important;\">Affiliate may also advertise merchant website on online channels such as Facebook, Instagram,... or offline classified channel ads, magazines, and newspapers.</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-top: 0.8em; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(68, 68, 68); color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-color-orange120\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(153, 92, 0); background-color: transparent !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3. Commissions and payment</strong></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.301961); margin-top: 0.8em; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; caret-color: rgb(68, 68, 68); color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-color-orange120\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(153, 92, 0); background-color: transparent !important;\">Refer any customer to make a purchase on our website, you wi